<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ cuts ArthroCare.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ cuts ArthroCare.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin analyst Steve Halper said he cut his rating on ArthroCare Corp to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst declined further comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock was trading up 1/4 at 7 in early trading Monday.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
